# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SECRETS - the most important entry in this file.
#
# db.properties holds a real MySQL username and password. Committing it would
# publish a live credential in the repository history, and it stays there even
# after you delete the file. That is why it is ignored, and why a
# db.properties.example IS committed instead.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
db.properties

